  introLines:
  - ORDER! ORDER IN MY VALLEY!
  - I have declared gravity ILLEGAL on Tuesdays.
  - And today, little student, is whatever day I SAY it is.
  finalDefeatLine: NO... YOU UNDERSTOOD THE SYSTEM!
  hintTaunts:
  - Pathetic! You forgot the NET force. Forces in opposite directions SUBTRACT, fool.
  - Objection! F = ma. You used F = m + a. I'm almost impressed.
  teachingLines:
  - '*sigh* This court is now a classroom. Against my will.'
  - Here. Sliders. Push the force up and watch the acceleration. Now add mass. See?
    Heavier things are LAZIER.
  - Change ONE thing at a time. That's how real physicists... ugh... learn. Now go
    away. No, wait, come back and fight me.
  rematchLine: SHOW ME WHAT YOU LEARNED.
